  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "@khorsheed/dsh-ankh-guard",
      "text": "> 镜像仓：与 [Khorsheed/dsh-plugins](https://github.com/Khorsheed/dsh-plugins) 的 `packages/ankh-guard` 自动同步。Issue 欢迎提在本仓；PR 请提交到 monorepo。\n>\n> [English](README.en.md) | 中文\n\n让 agent 自己改代码、自己重启，还不把服务搞挂。\n\n让 agent 改 dsh 自己的代码很方便，麻烦在重启那一下：改坏了，服务连同正在聊的会话一起挂掉，只能你去收拾。装上重启守卫，agent 想重启得先证明「构建和测试都过了」，过了才放行；重启后它自己检查新服务是否正常，起不来就自动退回上一个能用的版本，被打断的会话也会接着聊。\n\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Khorsheed/dsh-basic/main/docs/screenshots/ankh-guard.JPG\" width=\"560\" alt=\"一次受守护的重启:重启前告知验证项,重启后金丝雀自动激活会话并注入上下文继续验证\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "能做什么",
      "text": "- **没测过就不让重启**：构建或测试没过，agent 发起的重启直接被拦下，旧服务照常运行。\n- **重启前先预演**：真正停机前，先在后台把新版本完整启动一遍；起不来就不碰旧的。\n- **挂了自动退回**：新版本连续起不来，自动退回最后一次正常启动的版本；如果是新装的插件把服务搞坏了，就把它卸掉，并告诉你卸了什么。\n- **重启完自己汇报**：发起重启的那个会话会收到结果，不用你去翻日志。\n- **聊到一半的会话接着聊**：被重启打断的会话自动恢复，继续刚才的活。\n- **网页自己刷新回来**：开着的页面等新服务就绪后自动刷新，回到原来的位置。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "在 DSH 的「插件 → 添加插件」里输入下面的包名，点安装：\n\n```\n@khorsheed/dsh-ankh-guard\n```\n\n它也随「开发套件」（`@khorsheed/dsh-dev-suite`）一起提供。装好后让 agent 照着随包的「安全重启」说明操作就行。"
    },
    {
      "section": "用之前要准备好",
      "text": "- **部署目录是一个 git 仓库**：「测过了」的证明和退回旧版本都靠 git 记录。\n- **agent 不受沙箱限制**：启动 DSH 时设 `DSH_PERMISSION_MODE=danger-full-access`，或在会话里输入 `/permission danger-full-access`，否则 agent 没法停止和拉起服务。\n- **第一次重启交给命令行**：装好后先运行一次 `dsh-ankh-guard supervise`，把服务交给守卫看管；之后的重启 agent 自己就能完成。"
    },
    {
      "section": "已知限制",
      "text": "- 只管得了经过守卫的重启；绕开它手动停服务，仍可能把服务搞挂，这时由自动退回兜底。\n- 服务崩溃（而不是正常停止）时，被打断的会话不会自动续上，要等你打开它时才恢复。\n- 只支持 macOS 和 Linux。"
    },
    {
      "section": "Compatibility",
      "text": "需要 DSH 0.1.5 或更新版本，已在 0.2.1 上验证。"
    },
    {
      "section": "给开发者",
      "text": "- 命令行 `dsh-ankh-guard` 的全部命令、自我重启的六步流程、watchdog 和 launchd / systemd 的部署方式、启动配置切换、各配置项，都在[完整参考](https://github.com/Khorsheed/dsh-plugins/blob/main/packages/ankh-guard/docs/reference.md)里。\n- 入口：`src/index.ts`（应用内的服务和说明）、`src/cli.ts`（命令行）、`scripts/dsh-watchdog.sh`（watchdog）。\n- 在 [dsh-plugins](https://github.com/Khorsheed/dsh-plugins) 开发，另有单插件镜像仓 [dsh-ankh-guard](https://github.com/Khorsheed/dsh-ankh-guard)；变更见 [CHANGELOG.md](CHANGELOG.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "@khorsheed/dsh-ankh-guard",
      "text": "English | [中文](README.md)\n\nLet the agent change its own code and restart itself, without taking the service down."
    },
    {
      "section": "@khorsheed/dsh-ankh-guard",
      "text": "Having an agent edit dsh's own code is handy; the risky moment is the restart. If the change is broken, the service goes down along with every conversation in progress, and you're left to clean up. With the restart guard, the agent has to show that the build and tests passed before it may restart. After the restart it checks the new service on its own, falls back to the last working version if it won't come up, and the conversations that were cut off carry on."
    },
    {
      "section": "@khorsheed/dsh-ankh-guard",
      "text": "<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Khorsheed/dsh-basic/main/docs/screenshots/ankh-guard.JPG\" width=\"560\" alt=\"A guarded restart: the checks are announced before the restart, and afterwards the canary wakes the session with context so it can keep verifying\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "What it does",
      "text": "- **No tests, no restart**: if the build or tests didn't pass, the agent's restart is refused and the old service keeps running.\n- **A dry run first**: before anything stops, the new version is booted once in the background; if it can't start, the running one is left alone.\n- **Falls back on its own**: if the new version keeps failing to start, it goes back to the last version that started cleanly; if a newly installed plugin broke the service, that plugin is removed and you're told which one.\n- **Reports back when it's done**: the session that asked for the restart gets the result, so there's no log digging.\n- **Conversations pick up where they left off**: sessions cut off by the restart come back and continue what they were doing.\n- **Pages come back by themselves**: open browser tabs refresh once the new service is ready and return to where you were."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "In DSH, open Plugins → Add plugin, enter this package name, and press Install:\n\n```\n@khorsheed/dsh-ankh-guard\n```\n\nIt also comes with the Dev Suite (`@khorsheed/dsh-dev-suite`). Once installed, have the agent follow the bundled \"safe restart\" guide."
    },
    {
      "section": "Before you start",
      "text": "- **The deployment directory is a git repository**: the \"tests passed\" proof and the fallback to an earlier version both rely on git.\n- **The agent runs without a sandbox**: start DSH with `DSH_PERMISSION_MODE=danger-full-access`, or type `/permission danger-full-access` in the session; otherwise the agent cannot stop and start the service.\n- **The first restart goes through the command line**: after installing, run `dsh-ankh-guard supervise` once to hand the service to the guard; from then on the agent can restart on its own."
    },
    {
      "section": "Known limitations",
      "text": "- It only covers restarts that go through the guard; stopping the service by hand can still break it, and the automatic fallback is the safety net there.\n- After a crash (rather than a normal stop), interrupted sessions don't continue on their own; they recover when you open them.\n- macOS and Linux only."
    },
    {
      "section": "Compatibility",
      "text": "Needs DSH 0.1.5 or later; verified on 0.2.1."
    },
    {
      "section": "For developers",
      "text": "- Every `dsh-ankh-guard` command, the six-step self-restart protocol, the watchdog and launchd / systemd deployment shapes, launch-config cutover and all configuration options are in the [full reference](https://github.com/Khorsheed/dsh-plugins/blob/main/packages/ankh-guard/docs/reference.en.md).\n- Entry points: `src/index.ts` (the in-app service and guide), `src/cli.ts` (the CLI), `scripts/dsh-watchdog.sh` (the watchdog).\n- Developed in [dsh-plugins](https://github.com/Khorsheed/dsh-plugins), with a single-plugin mirror at [dsh-ankh-guard](https://github.com/Khorsheed/dsh-ankh-guard). Changes: [CHANGELOG.md](CHANGELOG.md)."
    }
  ],
